# Runtime-rewritten Trino access-control rules (per-org catalog grants appended
# by connections.ts). Bind-mounted at /etc/trino/access in the Trino container
# and at /trino-access in the app container — kept OUTSIDE the dynamic catalog
# scan dir (/etc/trino/catalog) so the .json never pollutes catalog loading.
# Never track the live file; it is seeded if missing.
lunapad-access-control.json
